nt-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-7028855-U" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>7028855</doc-number><kind>U</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-8217168-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>8217168</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMADA ATOMIZER COMPANY LIMITE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMADA HIROMICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMADA ATOMIZER COMPANY LIMITED</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMADA, HIROMICHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMADA HIROMICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMADA, HIROMICHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An implement enabling each user to positively split-inject various kinds of perfume by a simple attaching/detaching operation, comprising a multi-stage engaging unit (21) to be fitted to the outlet of a container (8) for storing therein perfume and toilet lotion, a push-operation head (2) provided with an outlet hole opened at the center of the engaging unit (21) and a dispensing pipe (1) connected to the outlet hole, whereby it is possible to split-inject small amounts of perfumes for transfer into separate containers and to carry a plurality of kinds of perfume.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention a trait à un dispositif permettant à un utilisateur d'injecter diverses sortes de parfum à l'aide d'une simple opération d'attachement/détachement. Ce dispositif comporte une unité emboîtante à plusieurs étage (21) à raccorder à l'orifice de sortie d'un contenant (8) pour y stocker du parfum ou une lotion de toilette, une tête fonctionnant sous une poussée (2) pourvue d'un orifice de sortie ouvert au centre de l'unité emboîtante (21) et un tube distributeur (1) connecté à cet orifice de sortie. Il est, de ce fait, possible d'injecter de petites quantités de parfum pour les transférer dans des contenants distincts et de transporter plusieurs sortes de parfum.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>